NAME
       terminal - the PureC terminal emulator

SYNOPSIS
       terminal

DESCRIPTION
       A tabbed xterm compatible terminal running sh on a pseudo terminal. It
       supports 256 colors and true color, the alternate screen used by vim and
       htop, line drawing characters and a 3000 line scrollback. Colors follow
       the system theme chosen in Settings.

SHORTCUTS
       Ctrl+Shift+T       new tab                 Ctrl+Shift+W    close tab
       Ctrl+Tab           next tab                Ctrl+= / Ctrl+- / Ctrl+0   font size
       Shift+PgUp/PgDn    scroll history          mouse wheel     scroll history

EXAMPLES
       terminal

SEE ALSO
       sh(1), clear(1)
